  "jei.italiansdelight.plants.olive": "Olive trees grow from olive saplings. Plant four saplings in a 2x2 square to grow an ancient olive tree. The trees are not yet generated naturally in biomes.\n\nNaturally grown, exposed leaves can produce olives. About 65% of eligible leaves are productive at a time, with a new selection every four Minecraft days per leaf. Right-click ripe leaves to collect 1–3 olives; bone meal advances a selected natural leaf by one stage.\n\nWith Serene Seasons, olives ripen outdoors in autumn. Greenhouse glass above the leaves permits fruiting outside the normal season.",
  "jei.italiansdelight.plants.almond": "Grow an almond tree by planting an almond sapling. Almond trees are not yet generated naturally in biomes.\n\nOnly naturally grown, exposed leaves can produce almonds. About 65% of eligible leaves are productive at a time; their selection changes every four Minecraft days per leaf. Right-click ripe leaves for 1–3 almonds. Bone meal advances a selected natural leaf one stage at a time.\n\nWith Serene Seasons, flowers appear in spring and almonds ripen from late summer to mid-autumn. A greenhouse allows off-season fruiting. Leaves keep their autumn colors through winter.",
  "jei.italiansdelight.plants.fruit_cherry": "Plant a fruit cherry sapling to grow a cherry tree with green leaves, white spring blossoms and red cherries. These trees are not yet generated naturally in biomes.\n\nOnly naturally grown, exposed leaves can bear fruit. Around 65% of eligible leaves are productive; the selection rotates every four Minecraft days per leaf. Right-click ripe leaves for 1–3 cherries. Bone meal advances a selected natural leaf by one stage.\n\nWith Serene Seasons, cherry flowers appear in spring and ripe cherries in summer. A greenhouse permits fruiting outside the season. Autumn-colored leaves remain visible in winter.",
  "jei.italiansdelight.plants.basil": "Wild basil grows in plains, meadows, forests, birch forests, flower forests, cherry groves and sparse jungles. Break the wild plant to collect basil, then plant basil directly on farmland; no separate seed is needed.\n\nCultivated basil grows through the normal eight crop ages (0–7), like wheat. Bone meal accelerates crop growth, while applying it to wild basil can spread nearby wild plants.\n\nWith Serene Seasons, basil grows normally in spring and summer and more slowly during autumn and winter (with the default season settings). Greenhouses allow normal growth outside the fertile seasons.",
  "jei.italiansdelight.plants.cardoon": "Wild cardoon grows in plains, meadows and savannas. Collect cardoon from the wild plant and plant the cultivated form directly on farmland; no separate seed item is needed.\n\nCultivated cardoon has eight growth ages (0–7) and responds to bone meal like a vanilla crop. Bone meal used on wild cardoon can spread additional wild plants nearby.\n\nWith Serene Seasons, cardoon grows normally in spring, summer and autumn. It grows more slowly in winter with the default settings. A greenhouse allows normal growth in winter.",
