  "jei.italiansdelight.fluids.olive_oil": "Olive oil is made in the Crushing Tub. Put olives into the tub, then jump on it: every landing consumes one olive and produces 250 mB of olive oil.\n\nThe tub holds up to 8,000 mB. Draw 250 mB with an empty glass bottle, or 1,000 mB with an empty bucket. Store it in a Liquid Barrel (16,000 mB), pour it into a cauldron, or place it in the world using the bucket. One filled bucket and four empty bottles also craft into four oil bottles.",
  "jei.italiansdelight.fluids.apple_juice": "Apple juice is made by crushing apples in the Crushing Tub. Insert apples and jump onto the tub: each apple yields 250 mB of juice and one apple seed as a byproduct.\n\nThe tub holds 8,000 mB. Draw 250 mB into a glass bottle or 1,000 mB into a bucket. Apple juice can be kept in a Liquid Barrel, placed in a custom-fluid cauldron or poured into the world. A bucket of juice and four empty glass bottles craft into four juice bottles.",
  "jei.italiansdelight.fluids.sheep_milk": "Get sheep milk by using an empty bucket on an adult sheep, like milking a vanilla cow. Baby sheep cannot be milked.\n\nAt a crafting table, combine one sheep milk bucket with four empty glass bottles to get four sheep milk bottles (250 mB each) and the empty bucket back. Sheep milk is used in cheese making.",
  "jei.italiansdelight.fluids.whey": "Whey is a byproduct of some Cheese Vat recipes. The vat stores up to 4,000 mB of whey in its internal tank.\n\nPlace an empty glass bottle or bucket in the dedicated whey-container slot. It fills with 250 mB or 1,000 mB when sufficient whey is available. You can also craft four whey bottles from a whey bucket and four empty bottles. Whey is used in further cheese recipes.",
