  "jei.italiansdelight.fluids.rennet": "Rennet is a liquid ingredient used in cheese making. Bottles contain 250 mB and buckets 1,000 mB; both can transfer into Barrels and cauldrons. It is not placeable in the world.",
  "jei.italiansdelight.fluids.apple_cider_vinegar": "Apple cider vinegar is a liquid ingredient from the mod. Bottles hold 250 mB and buckets 1,000 mB; it can be stored in Barrels and cauldrons. It is not placeable in the world.",
